#heading(outlined: true, bookmarked: true, numbering: none)[List of Abbreviations]

/ ABSTIME: Absolute time mode (timerfd flag)
/ ALU: Arithmetic Logic Unit
/ API: Application Programming Interface
/ BCM: Broadcom (SoC family)
/ CLI: Command Line Interface
/ CPU: Central Processing Unit
/ CRC: Cyclic Redundancy Check
/ DRS: Distributed Real-Time System
/ DSO: Digital Storage Oscilloscope
/ DVFS: Dynamic Voltage and Frequency Scaling
/ EWMA: Exponentially Weighted Moving Average
/ FIFO: First In, First Out (scheduling policy)
/ FSM: Finite State Machine
/ GbE: Gigabit Ethernet
/ GPIO: General Purpose Input/Output
/ IGMP: Internet Group Management Protocol
/ IP: Internet Protocol
/ IRQ: Interrupt Request
/ KISS: Keep It Simple, Stupid
/ LOC: Lines of Code
/ MAC: Media Access Control
/ mmap: Memory-Mapped File I/O
/ NIC: Network Interface Controller
/ NTP: Network Time Protocol
/ OS: Operating System
/ PI: Proportional-Integral (controller)
/ POSIX: Portable Operating System Interface
/ ppm: Parts Per Million
/ PRNG: Pseudo-Random Number Generator
/ PTP: Precision Time Protocol
/ RT: Real-Time
/ RTT: Round-Trip Time
/ SHM: Shared Memory
/ SoC: System on Chip
/ TUI: Text User Interface
/ UDP: User Datagram Protocol
/ UUID: Universally Unique Identifier
